{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0176-s001", "text": "FPA betalar in studiepenningen på ditt konto månatligen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045147678179+0000-3/hb-c08-u0176-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.25482177734375, "generation_seconds": 23.18914207792841, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0176-s002", "text": "På studiepenningens belopp inverkar många omständigheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045147678179+0000-3/hb-c08-u0176-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.258453369140625, "generation_seconds": 22.172375062014908, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0176-s003", "text": "På studiepenningens belopp inverkar bland annat din ålder, om du bor i ditt eget hem eller hos föräldrarna, om du är gift och om du har minderåriga barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045147678179+0000-3/hb-c08-u0176-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.747755102040816, "peak": 0.281341552734375, "generation_seconds": 45.97117373300716, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0177-s001", "text": "Det är inte obligatoriskt att ta studielån.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045147678179+0000-3/hb-c08-u0177-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.343841552734375, "generation_seconds": 16.75926072895527, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0177-s002", "text": "Du kan högst ta ut lån till ett visst maximibelopp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045147678179+0000-3/hb-c08-u0177-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.30303955078125, "generation_seconds": 19.15874393400736, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0177-s003", "text": "Du väljer själv hur mycket studielån du vill ta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045147678179+0000-3/hb-c08-u0177-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.271331787109375, "generation_seconds": 17.68768849200569, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0177-s004", "text": "Studielånet är ett lån för vilket finska staten beviljar statsgaranti.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045147678179+0000-3/hb-c08-u0177-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.2620849609375, "generation_seconds": 21.311068903189152, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0177-s005", "text": "Du ansöker om lånet i banken när du har fått FPA:s beslut om statsgaranti.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045147678179+0000-3/hb-c08-u0177-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.344451904296875, "generation_seconds": 19.163751425920054, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
